	)) (text "U1 NXP MCIMX6Y2CVM08AB (i.MX 6ULL full feature, 792 MHz, -40..105 C, MAPBGA-289 14x14 mm passo 0.8). Sfere: IMX6ULLCEC Rev 1.2 tabelle 90/91, confrontate con la netlist di una scheda KiCad aperta: 289/289." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 17.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "92c50683-b38b-4825-9a8d-1b4030a01051")) (text "Boot: BOOT_MODE[1:0]=10 (boot interno) e BOOT_CFG tutti bassi con i pull-down interni da 100k (tabella 78) = QSPI, come SW601 tutto OFF sulla EVK NXP. Pull-up DNP su LCD_DATA04 e LCD_DATA06 (microSD). Se QSPI e' vuota il ROM va in download seriale su USB_OTG1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 22.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "68cef41a-7d30-4992-9796-c26b0466d285")) (text "Assegnazione: ECSPI2=BUS_POWER, ECSPI1=MAIN, I2C2=bus MIKILAB, I2C1=EEPROM MAC, UART1=console, UART3=GNSS, UART8=BT, GPT1 CAPTURE1=PPS (UART2_TX), CAPTURE2=EXTINT (UART2_RX). Elenco completo in docs/pinmap-imx6ull.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.00 27.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "033ed446-03e6-492a-a5d1-c317c98595ce")) (wire (pts (xy 52.07 72.39) (xy 46.99 72.39)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "46850803-8218-46c8-8d8e-ac1a1504db1a")) (label "DDR_A0" (at 46.99 72.39 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "b5157d36-1436-43ef-9788-f04c3dab878b")) (wire (pts (xy 52.07 74.93) (xy 46.99 74.93)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "2af5ee79-5171-47d1-bceb-d7634f2bff82")) (label "DDR_A1" (at 46.99 74.93 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "5e1ba53b-0644-44c9-8aad-fae8b99d4d0e")) (wire (pts (xy 52.07 77.47) (xy 46.99 77.47)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "cea0f261-462b-4276-9ce6-4082ce8535f1")) (label "DDR_A2" (at 46.99 77.47 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "bf15805f-c496-4a56-ba60-7a3fb8ed970a")) (wire (pts (xy 52.07 80.01) (xy 46.99 80.01)) (stro